{"issue": 86, "stage": "reply", "reply_id": "IC_kwDORdtOLc8AAAABeiYQ-g", "author": "MikeEchoVoid", "created": "2026-10-22T15:16:51Z", "excerpt": "Confirmed fixed (checked on 1.8.13, which carries T-4040).\n\nIn a throwaway container, a fresh `fw init --provider claude` seeds T-002 with `target_blast_radius: 3` and `voi_score: 0.5`. Fed an Edit on that file, `check-inception-schema.py` exits 0; with `voi_score` removed it exits 2, so the gate still bites. I did not run a full agent session on the fresh project. Thank you.\n", "answered": false, "ts": "2026-10-22T20:17:05Z"}
